OL,3,AMother and daughter die after suspected
OL,4,Agrizzly bear attack in Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother and daughter have died after a
OL,7,Fsuspected grizzly bear attack in the
OL,8,FCanadian province of British Columbia,
OL,9,Ftheir family has announced.
OL,11,FThe women - identified as Jennifer
OL,12,FBalcarras, 48, and her daughter Selah
OL,13,FReed, 20 -were reported missing on 1
OL,14,FNovember when they did not return from
OL,15,Fwhat was supposed to be a short
OL,16,Fafternoon walk, the family said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
