OL,3,AMother and daughter die after suspected
OL,4,Agrizzly bear attack in Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir remains were found in a trail
OL,7,Farea in Bella Coola, according to the
OL,8,FBC Conservation Officer Service
OL,9,F(BCCOS), which said evidence at the
OL,10,Fscene "suggested an animal may have
OL,11,Fbeen involved".
OL,13,FConservation officers are working to
OL,14,Ftrack down any bears involved.
